OL,3,AGovernment minister calls for review of
OL,4,A'unacceptable' BBC Scotland channel
OL,5,Aclosure
OL,6,
OL,7,FCulture Secretary MC iri McAllan has
OL,8,Furged Ofcom to review "wholly
OL,9,Funacceptable" plans to close the linear
OL,10,FBBC Scotland channel.
OL,12,FThe BBC last week announced the
OL,13,Fdedicated Scotland channel - as well as
OL,14,FBBC Three and Radio 4 Extra - would
OL,15,Fmove online as part of measures to make
OL,16,F#500m of savings by 2028.
OL,18,FMcAllan said moving the channel online
OL,19,Fwould "reverse progress in improving
OL,20,Fthe visibility and representation of
OL,21,FScotland within the UK's broadcasting
OL,22,Flandscape".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
